Well, it, uh...
It came from the heart.
ດີ, ມັນ, ອູ... ມັນມາຈາກຫົວໃຈ.

488
00:29:41,057 --> 00:29:45,013
Well, keep it coming.
All right, people, good work!
ດີ,ສືບຕໍ່ມາ.ດີແລ້ວ
